  "content": "\n\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/wishful-recipes\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/4xVp9RM1/wishcraft(2).png\" alt=\"本模組已併入 Wishful Recipes。點擊此處查看。它能獨立動態生成配方，意味著與其他模組高度相容且所需設定較少。\"></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/bGJxy23.png\" alt=\"標題\"></p>\n<h5 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/2CUh6gMuCt\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/1027252425960198165?color=5b6ee1&label=Discord&style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=white\" alt=\"Discord\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/MarsThePlanet\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/endpoint.svg?url=https://shieldsio-patreon.vercel.app/api?username=MarsThePlanet&type=patrons&style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"在 Patreon 上支持我\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/smelting-cobblestone-in-blast-a-furnace-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/845281?color=F16436&logo=curseforge&logoColor=white&label=Curseforge&style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"CurseForge\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252fsmelting-cobblestone-in-blast-a-furnace-fabricforge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/smelting-cobblestone-in-blast-a-furnace-fabricforge?style=for-the-badge&logo=modrinth&logoColor=white&label=modrinth&color=00AF5C\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a> </strong></h5>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><br>此模組支援完全自訂設定，讓您在高爐中燒製所有石頭方塊的速度比在普通熔爐中快兩倍。預設情況下，它會為鵝卵石、石頭、石磚、粗製深板岩、深板岩磚、深板岩瓦、砂岩、紅砂岩、地獄磚、玄武岩、磨製黑石磚、石英塊和下界岩添加燒製配方，但您可以在設定檔中添加更多或移除它們。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/feFVgxd.png\" alt=\"\" height=\"270\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sf89fRO.png\" alt=\"\" height=\"270\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/EFCLsqg.png\" alt=\"\" height=\"270\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/zwqoQ5q.png\" alt=\"\" height=\"270\"></p>\n<p><strong>設定</strong></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>您可以直接在遊戲內設定此模組，或編輯您的遊戲資料夾中的 JSON 檔案 <code>config/blastingstone.json</code>。請注意，任何變更都需要重新啟動 Minecraft 才能生效。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>blasting_list</strong> - 字串列表，每個字串代表一個燒製配方，指定輸入物品、輸出物品以及燒製獲得的經驗值</p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/JNZ2GMV.png\"> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/deimos-fabric-forge-neoforge\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/83sD0W8.png\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fdeimos\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/j2GIPnt.png\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/marstheplanet\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/rJIRiP5.png\"></a></p>",
